WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.500
Three cars.

2
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.590
One road trip.

3
00:00:02.950 --> 00:00:04.140
And somehow…

4
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:06.190
nobody knows where anyone is.

5
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:08.090
The plan's in a group chat.

6
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:09.740
The route's in a maps app.

7
00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:10.750
And the money?

8
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.230
That's next week's problem.

9
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:14.310
Meet Roadpack.

10
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:15.900
Separate cars.

11
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:16.840
One Pack.

12
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.670
Every vehicle on one live map.

13
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:21.120
Who's ahead,

14
00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.100
who's behind,

15
00:00:22.200 --> 00:00:23.990
and how close you really are.

16
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:25.680
Need a coffee?

17
00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:26.770
Ask the Pack.

18
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.280
Roadpack finds stops along your route,

19
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.310
shows the detour before you commit,

20
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.720
and everyone votes right from the road.

21
00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:39.160
If someone has to pull over,

22
00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.860
one tap tells the whole Pack where they are.

23
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.420
One shared plan.

24
00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:45.280
Costs split on the trip,

25
00:00:45.250 --> 00:00:46.200
not a week later.

26
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.140
And when the drive is over,

27
00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:51.930
Rewind flies you back over the road you actually drove.

28
00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:54.550
Friends.

29
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:56.010
Families.

30
00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.610
Whole clubs.

31
00:00:58.900 --> 00:00:59.870
Roadpack.

32
00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.560
Stay with your Pack.

33
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:03.220
Free on the App Store.
